    {
      "agent_id": "medical-coding-agent",
      "case_id": "negated-only",
      "input_text": "出院记录：入院时考虑肺炎，后经复查已排除；未形成其他确诊诊断，未实施手术。",
      "assertions": [
        {"path": "uncodable_items", "op": "nonempty"},
        {"path": "human_review", "op": "nonempty"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "agent_id": "note-completeness-agent",
      "case_id": "severely-incomplete-note",
      "input_text": "主诉：腰背痛。诊断：骨质疏松。没有现病史、既往史、体格检查、辅助检查和治疗经过。",
      "assertions": [
        {"path": "missing_sections", "op": "nonempty"},
        {"path": "completeness_score", "op": "number_lt", "value": 1.0}
      ]
    },
    {
      "agent_id": "nursing-handoff",
      "case_id": "missing-safety-state",
      "input_text": "患者：患者甲\n主要问题：术后回病房\n当前状态：生命体征、意识和疼痛均未记录\n待办：接班护士核对身份、管路、用药和待办记录\n安全/预防：风险评估结果未记录，待接班护士核验",
      "assertions": [
